From: Lukin <mylukin@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Mar 2026 21:41:38 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 50/98] fix(feishu): track tool history and render thinking
 panel with dynamic titles

Improve streaming card tool activity tracking with grouped tool call
history, active tool counting, and dynamic thinking panel titles that
switch between thinking and tool activity contexts. Discard cards when
no final text arrives instead of leaving stale thinking-only cards.
